{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/7514ada7f2b77c9d495de8513254dd18.webp?t=1770361642\" width=358 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends as you dig your way into mysterious caves and craft powerful weapons and armor to survive in a procedurally generated sandbox world. Explore diverse biomes, hidden caverns, distant islands, dimensions, and even floating dungeons. Build a base and attract NPCs to advance the story. Uncover the truth behind this fractured and corrupted land. Will you stop the spreading evil before it consumes everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/8e6e4c523ce41155c8ec9a62becf342d.poster.avif?t=1770361642\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/8e6e4c523ce41155c8ec9a62becf342d.webm?t=1770361642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/8e6e4c523ce41155c8ec9a62becf342d.mp4?t=1770361642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/644f53033a8939ffbb20f7e10bd2c6c8.webp?t=1770361642\" width=358 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the hero you want to be. Pick from the Rogue, Warrior, Ranger, Mage, or Summoner, each with their own unique skills, armor sets, and weapon styles. Master your class, unlock powerful abilities, and shape your playstyle as you dive deeper into the world\u2019s dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/9cf85a5aca445229b3b50acc72c93448.poster.avif?t=1770361642\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/9cf85a5aca445229b3b50acc72c93448.webm?t=1770361642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/9cf85a5aca445229b3b50acc72c93448.mp4?t=1770361642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/4c33578a4260d63dd72333b5557593ae.webp?t=1770361642\" width=358 height=53 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated voxel world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer co\u2011op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes with unique progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main quests and side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse surface and underground environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming, mounts, and pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons and rare loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/07c483f7e1ab66187d6f191f770e7e73.poster.avif?t=1770361642\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/07c483f7e1ab66187d6f191f770e7e73.webm?t=1770361642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/07c483f7e1ab66187d6f191f770e7e73.mp4?t=1770361642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/f756636c122520d37c870b7cbb7efd37.webp?t=1770361642\" width=464 height=53 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shipwrecked and stranded, you awaken on an island overwhelmed by danger. Strange creatures haunt the dreams of its people, and a growing corruption threatens to swallow everything. The source of this evil is coming from the depths\u2026 far beyond what anyone has dared to explore. You are the last hope to reclaim the land. Uncover the mysteries buried beneath the stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/extras/28d9bc37f14a96143afc02f8271fcaba.avif?t=1770361642\" width=922 height=78 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1856810?t=1770361642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/0745a78e34bf0f1d8d9a362e2b768c8a70884870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770361642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/2290535a1c8e0ce841da96746b6e96754226bfe9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770361642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1856810/2290535a1c8e0ce841da96746b6e96754226bfe9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770361642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2812130,"de